<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/news.css" />
<!-- Main Home Page -->
<main class="site-main home-page">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section id="hero" class="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg" style="background-image:url('/images/home/Header_1.svg');"></div>
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>

    
    <div class="section-inner hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-content fade-up">
        <h1>Alleycats Soccer Club</h1>
        <p>At Alleycats Soccer Club, we foster confident, hardworking, and creative players through a supportive, high-level training environment.</p>
        <a href="/join" class="btn btn-outline-light">Try Out</a>
      </div>
    </div>

     </section>

  <!-- PARTNERS BAR -->
  <section class="partners" aria-label="Club partners and affiliates">
    <div class="section-inner partners-inner">
      <img src="/images/home/ECNL.png" alt="ECNL" class="partner-logo" loading="lazy" />
      <img src="/images/home/MID-ATLANTIC.png" alt="Mid-Atlantic" class="partner-logo" loading="lazy" />
      <img src="/images/home/PUMA.png" alt="PUMA" class="partner-logo" loading="lazy" />
      <img src="/images/home/US-CLUB-SOCCER.png" alt="US Club Soccer" class="partner-logo" loading="lazy" />
      <img src="/images/home/NJ-YOUTH-SOCCER.png" alt="NJ Youth Soccer" class="partner-logo" loading="lazy" />
      <img src="/images/home/ALLEYCATS.png" alt="Alleycats" class="partner-logo" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TEAMS / PROGRAMS -->
  <section id="programs" class="section programs">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <header class="section-header section-header-center fade-up">
        <h2 class="section-title">Teams / Programs</h2>
        <p>At Alleycats Soccer Club, we develop players at every level through quality coaching, real competition, and a culture of excellence and sportsmanship. 2025–26 season tryouts are coming soon (expected mid-June).</p>
      </header>

      <div class="programs-grid">
        <article class="program-card fade-up">
          <img src="/images/home/Teams1.png" alt="Joining the Alleycats" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="program-card-overlay">
            <h3>Interested in joining the Alleycats</h3>
            <span class="btn btn-red btn-small btn--disabled">Prospective Player Form</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="program-card fade-up" style="transition-delay:.1s">
          <img src="/images/home/Teams2.png" alt="Register a Player" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="program-card-overlay">
            <h3>Register a Player (Required Guardian's Information)</h3>
            <a href="https://playmetrics.com/signup?clubToken=TG9naW4tQ2x1Yi52MS0zNjMtMTY1NzQ3ODk3MXx4MWNCUGpGU0w0YTZxV1c0Z0NFUDlMWEhta01nT0tmcWo0MnBjRU50b2UwPQ%3D%3D&program_id=3443" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-red btn-small">Register Now</a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STATS -->
  <section class="stats-section" style="background-image:linear-gradient(269.74deg, rgba(0,20,46,0.90) 35.51%, rgba(26,50,80,0.90) 78.26%), url('/images/home/Proven.svg');">
    <div class="section-inner stats-layout">
      <div class="stats-heading fade-up">We Have a Proven Track Record of Success</div>

      <div class="stats-list">
        <div class="stat-row fade-up">
          <div class="stat-number" data-target="450">0<span>+</span></div>
          <div class="stat-label">Youth Female Players</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-row fade-up" style="transition-delay:.07s">
          <div class="stat-number" data-target="100">0<span>+</span></div>
          <div class="stat-label">Women Currently Playing in College</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-row fade-up" style="transition-delay:.14s">
          <div class="stat-number" data-target="65">0<span>+</span></div>
          <div class="stat-label">High School All Stars in Fall of 2025</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-row fade-up" style="transition-delay:.21s">
          <div class="stat-number" data-target="20">0<span>+</span></div>
          <div class="stat-label">Girls Invited to Gotham FC NWSL ID and Showcase Events</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-row fade-up" style="transition-delay:.28s">
          <div class="stat-number" data-target="7">0<span>+</span></div>
          <div class="stat-label">Players Called into US Youth National Team ID Centers and Camps</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-row fade-up" style="transition-delay:.35s">
          <div class="stat-number">2</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Current Professional Players with 1 US Women's National Team Player</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- NEWS -->
  <section id="news" class="section news">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <header class="section-header section-header-row">
        <h2 class="section-title-left fade-up">Cats in the News</h2>
        <a href="/news" class="text-link fade-up">View All</a>
      </header>

      <div class="card-grid card-grid-3">
        <article class="news-card fade-up">
          <a href="https://www.timesunion.com/sports/article/espn-uswnt-claire-hutton-best-womens-soccer-bay-fc-22186802.php" class="news-card__link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <img src="/images/news/1.svg" alt="Claire Hutton ESPN U-21" class="news-card__image" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="news-card__body">
              <span class="news-badge">New</span>
              <time datetime="2026-04-03">Apr 3, 2026</time>
              <h3>Bethlehem graduate Claire Hutton cracks ESPN's U-21 soccer global top 10, gets USWNT call-up</h3>
              <span class="news-read-more">Read More →</span>
            </div>
          </a>
        </article>

        <article class="news-card fade-up" style="transition-delay:.1s">
          <a href="https://www.espn.com/soccer/story/_/id/48081715/lopez-caicedo-thompson-lead-best-women-soccer-players-u21" class="news-card__link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <img src="/images/news/2.svg" alt="Best U21 Women's Soccer Players" class="news-card__image" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="news-card__body">
              <span class="news-badge">New</span>
              <time datetime="2026-04-02">Apr 2, 2026</time>
              <h3>López, Caicedo, Thompson lead best U21 women's soccer players</h3>
              <span class="news-read-more">Read More →</span>
            </div>
          </a>
        </article>

        <article class="news-card fade-up" style="transition-delay:.2s">
          <a href="https://www.timesunion.com/sports/article/uswnt-shebelieves-claire-hutton-bay-fc-soccer-21959328.php" class="news-card__link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <img src="/images/news/3.svg" alt="Claire Hutton Bay FC USWNT" class="news-card__image" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="news-card__body">
              <time datetime="2026-03-10">Mar 10, 2026</time>
              <h3>Patience and possibility: Claire Hutton begins next chapter with Bay FC, USWNT</h3>
              <span class="news-read-more">Read More →</span>
            </div>
          </a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SOCIAL WALL -->
  <section class="section social">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <header class="section-header section-header-row">
        <h2 class="section-title-left fade-up">Social Wall</h2>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/albanyalleycats/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-link fade-up">Visit Instagram</a>
      </header>

      <div class="card-grid card-grid-3 social-grid">
        {{#if instagram}}
        {{#each instagram}}
        <article class="social-card fade-up" style="transition-delay:{{delay}}s">
          <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:block;color:inherit;">
            <div class="social-card-img">
              <img src="{{image}}" alt="Instagram post" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
            <div class="social-card-body">
              <p class="social-card-caption">{{caption}}</p>
              <p class="social-card-date">{{date}}</p>
              <div class="social-card-footer">
                <div class="social-card-account">
                  <div class="social-avatar-img"><img src="/images/home/insta_profile.svg" alt="AC" loading="lazy" /></div>
                  <div>
                    <div class="social-handle">@albanyalleycats</div>
                    <div class="social-name">Alleycats Soccer Club</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                {{#if likes}}<div class="social-likes"><span class="heart-icon">♥</span><span class="likes-count">{{likes}}</span></div>{{/if}}
              </div>
            </div>
          </a>
        </article>
        {{/each}}
        {{else}}
        <article class="social-card fade-up">
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/DX2EpK3juU3/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:block;color:inherit;">
            <div class="social-card-img">
              <img src="/images/home/insta1.svg" alt="Committed" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
            <div class="social-card-body">
              <p class="social-card-caption">Congratulations to Grace Bancheri on her commitment to SUNY ..</p>
              <p class="social-card-date">02 May, 2026</p>
              <div class="social-card-footer">
                <div class="social-card-account">
                  <div class="social-avatar-img"><img src="/images/home/insta_profile.svg" alt="AC" loading="lazy" /></div>
                  <div>
                    <div class="social-handle">@albanyalleycats</div>
                    <div class="social-name">Alleycats Soccer Club</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="social-likes"><span class="heart-icon">♥</span><span class="likes-count">66</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </a>
        </article>

        <article class="social-card fade-up" style="transition-delay:.1s">
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/DX1Zk4CERIE/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:block;color:inherit;">
            <div class="social-card-img">
              <img src="/images/home/insta2.svg" alt="Game Day" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
            <div class="social-card-body">
              <p class="social-card-caption">GAME DAY! Our 2014 Pre ECNL RL girls are traveling to Massachusetts</p>
              <p class="social-card-date">02 May, 2026</p>
              <div class="social-card-footer">
                <div class="social-card-account">
                  <div class="social-avatar-img"><img src="/images/home/insta_profile.svg" alt="AC" loading="lazy" /></div>
                  <div>
                    <div class="social-handle">@albanyalleycats</div>
                    <div class="social-name">Alleycats Soccer Club</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="social-likes"><span class="heart-icon">♥</span><span class="likes-count">27</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </a>
        </article>

        <article class="social-card fade-up" style="transition-delay:.2s">
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/DXzZehxDn3z/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:block;color:inherit;">
            <div class="social-card-img">
              <img src="/images/home/insta3.svg" alt="Committed" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
            <div class="social-card-body">
              <p class="social-card-caption">Congratulations to Lucy Vattimo on her commitment to play college ..</p>
              <p class="social-card-date">01 May, 2026</p>
              <div class="social-card-footer">
                <div class="social-card-account">
                  <div class="social-avatar-img"><img src="/images/home/insta_profile.svg" alt="AC" loading="lazy" /></div>
                  <div>
                    <div class="social-handle">@albanyalleycats</div>
                    <div class="social-name">Alleycats Soccer Club</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="social-likes"><span class="heart-icon">♥</span><span class="likes-count">125</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </a>
        </article>
        {{/if}}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STORE -->
  <section class="store">
    <div class="store-banner">
      <div class="section-inner store-banner-text">Official Club Store 2026 Season</div>
    </div>

    <div class="store-section">
      <div class="store-left">
        <h3 class="store-title">Uniform Kits<br>Team Apparel</h3>
        <p class="store-desc">Shop official Alleycats gear and represent the club on and off the field.</p>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-red">Shop Now</a>
      </div>

      <div class="store-products">
        <article class="store-product">
          <img src="/images/home/pants.png" alt="Team Pants" class="store-product-img" loading="lazy" />
          <a href="https://afrimsports.store/shop/alleycat-sweatpants/" class="store-product-link">View More</a>
        </article>
        <article class="store-product">
          <img src="/images/home/top.png" alt="Team Top" class="store-product-img" loading="lazy" />
          <a href="https://afrimsports.store/shop/alleycats-classic-1-4-zip/" class="store-product-link">View More</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- COACHES -->
  <section id="coaches" class="section coaches">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <h2 class="section-title coaches-title fade-up">Coach &amp; Director</h2>

      <div class="coaches-grid">
        <article class="coach-card fade-up">
          <div class="coach-photo"><img src="/images/home/Skip.png" alt="Skip Dawson" loading="lazy" /></div>
          <div class="coach-name">Skip Dawson</div>
          <div class="coach-role">Administrative Director</div>
        </article>

        <article class="coach-card fade-up" style="transition-delay:.08s">
          <div class="coach-photo"><img src="/images/home/Besty.png" alt="Betsy Drambour" loading="lazy" /></div>
          <div class="coach-name">Betsy Drambour</div>
          <div class="coach-role">Technical Director</div>
        </article>

        <article class="coach-card fade-up" style="transition-delay:.16s">
          <div class="coach-photo"><img src="/images/home/Chris.png" alt="Chris Le" loading="lazy" /></div>
          <div class="coach-name">Chris Le</div>
          <div class="coach-role">Director of Coaching</div>
        </article>

        <article class="coach-card fade-up" style="transition-delay:.24s">
          <div class="coach-photo"><img src="/images/home/Afrim.png" alt="Afrim Nezaj" loading="lazy" /></div>
          <div class="coach-name">Afrim Nezaj</div>
          <div class="coach-role">Founder/Executive Director</div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="coaches-cta fade-up">
        <a href="/coaches" class="btn btn-outline-red">Discover More</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SPONSORS -->
  <section class="section sponsors">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <h2 class="section-title sponsors-title fade-up">Affiliates &amp; Sponsors</h2>

      <div class="sponsors-grid fade-up">
        <img class="sponsor-logo" src="/images/home/sponsor/1.svg" alt="Sponsor 1" loading="lazy" />
        <img class="sponsor-logo" src="/images/home/sponsor/2.svg" alt="Sponsor 2" loading="lazy" />
        <img class="sponsor-logo" src="/images/home/sponsor/3.svg" alt="Sponsor 3" loading="lazy" />
        <img class="sponsor-logo" src="/images/home/sponsor/4.svg" alt="Sponsor 4" loading="lazy" />
        <img class="sponsor-logo" src="/images/home/sponsor/5.svg" alt="Sponsor 5" loading="lazy" />
        <img class="sponsor-logo" src="/images/home/sponsor/6.svg" alt="Sponsor 6" loading="lazy" />
        <img class="sponsor-logo" src="/images/home/sponsor/7.svg" alt="Sponsor 7" loading="lazy" />
        <img class="sponsor-logo" src="/images/home/sponsor/8.svg" alt="Sponsor 8" loading="lazy" />
        <img class="sponsor-logo" src="/images/home/sponsor/9.svg" alt="Sponsor 9" loading="lazy" />
        <img class="sponsor-logo" src="/images/home/sponsor/10.svg" alt="Sponsor 10" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TESTIMONIAL SLIDER -->
  <section class="section testimonial-section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="ts-slider" aria-label="Parent testimonials">
        <article class="ts-slide ts-slide--light active">
          <img class="ts-bg" src="/images/home/testimonial1.svg" alt="" />
          <div class="ts-inner">
            <img class="ts-icon" src="/images/home/testimonial_icon.png" alt="" />
            <blockquote>
              <p>Claire started with Alleycats Soccer Club when she was 9 years old, and it was an incredible experience for our family. The club created a true family environment where players felt supported, and the dedicated coaches genuinely cared while pushing each player to improve.</p>
              <p>We saw tremendous growth in Claire's skills and confidence during her time there. She has since gone on to play professionally and represent the U.S. Women's National Team, and we truly believe Alleycats played an important role in her development. We're very grateful for our experience and would highly recommend the club.</p>
            </blockquote>
          </div>
          <div class="ts-bottom">
            <div class="ts-author">Jen Hutton</div>
            <div class="ts-role">Daughter Claire (US Women's National Team and Bay FC of the NWSL)</div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="ts-slide ts-slide--dark">
          <img class="ts-bg" src="/images/home/testimonial2.svg" alt="" />
          <div class="ts-inner">
            <img class="ts-icon" src="/images/home/testimonial_icon.png" alt="" />
            <blockquote>
              <p>I cannot say enough great things about the Albany Alleycats. Both of my daughters, Lauren and Megan, have had the privilege of playing for this incredible club, and the experience has been nothing short of life-changing for both of them.</p>
              <p>What sets the Alleycats apart is their commitment to developing the whole athlete — not only skills and conditioning, but also confidence, mental wellbeing, and personal growth. My daughters were challenged to be their best while always feeling supported and valued on and off the field. The friendships they have made with teammates and coaches will last a lifetime. This is a club that truly cares about the people in it, not just the sport. Highly recommended.</p>
            </blockquote>
          </div>
          <div class="ts-bottom">
            <div class="ts-author">Jon Goyette</div>
            <div class="ts-role">Daughters Lauren (SUNY Oneonta Class of 2026) and Megan (Siena College Class of 2030)</div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="ts-slide ts-slide--light">
          <img class="ts-bg" src="/images/home/testimonial3.svg" alt="" />
          <div class="ts-inner">
            <img class="ts-icon" src="/images/home/testimonial_icon.png" alt="" />
            <blockquote>
              <p>My daughter, Nosa Omorogbe, spent six years with the Alleycats Soccer Club, and the growth we witnessed in her has been extraordinary and truly remarkable. The coaches and staff didn't just develop her as a player — they helped her build confidence, resilience, and leadership that extend far beyond the field.</p>
              <p>The discipline, teamwork, and self-belief she learned at the club have shaped her academics, friendships, and everyday life. Alleycats also opened doors to opportunities we never imagined were possible for her. We are truly grateful for the positive, supportive environment this club provides and for the meaningful role it played in Nosa’s development as both an athlete and a young woman.</p>
            </blockquote>
          </div>
          <div class="ts-bottom">
            <div class="ts-author">Amen M. Omorogbe</div>
            <div class="ts-role">Daughter Nosa (Columbia University Class of 2028)</div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <div class="ts-dots">
          <button class="ts-dot active" type="button" data-slide="0" aria-label="Slide 1"></button>
          <button class="ts-dot" type="button" data-slide="1" aria-label="Slide 2"></button>
          <button class="ts-dot" type="button" data-slide="2" aria-label="Slide 3"></button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>
